    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are adjacent to a wall or surface.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Anytime you can grip against a surface (such as when you Grab an Edge or Climb), you can cling closely against it and Take Cover. Even if the wall is exposed and would not normally do so, you still gain lesser cover, or improve lesser cover to standard cover if it was lesser. You are not considered off-guard when you cling and you do not have a climb speed, and gain a +2 circumstance bonus to resist attempts to knock you off the surface.</span></p>"
